From: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:08:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Linguablocks, a DSi language drill game with Tetris and
 chess
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Spanish/French vocabulary, sentence and conjugation drills built from the
Edexcel and AQA lists, with a strict 10 second timer and generated rule
explanations for every miss. Correct answers bank game time that pays for a
Tetris or chess mini-game, and all progress is saved to the SD card via libfat.
Ships with host-side logic tests (conjugation tables, question fuzzing, chess
perft) and builds warning-free with devkitARM/libnds.

Generated with Codebuff 🤖
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
